{{Documentation/Header}}
Marks a category as hidden. It applies the <code>__HIDDENCAT__</code> behaviour switch and displays an explanatory notice, so the category no longer appears at the foot of its member pages unless a reader has enabled hidden categories in their preferences.

Place it on the category page itself. Takes no parameters.

==Syntax==
{{T|Hidden Category}}

==Usage==
<pre>{{Hidden Category}}</pre>
Typical for maintenance and tracking categories that are useful to editors but noise for readers.

